# ============================================================================
# Research data — NEVER commit
#
# This repository is PUBLIC and the project is about privacy-preserving
# learning. Committing user-level data here would contradict the work itself,
# and git keeps every version forever — deleting a file later does not remove
# it from history.
#
# Everything below is distributed through the shared drive instead.
# See docs/data-access.md for the link, the layout, and the checksums.
# ============================================================================

# Task examples, cohort manifests and per-decision ranks — all carry user_id
INTERNAL_DO_NOT_UPLOAD_*
*INTERNAL*

# The source dataset and anything derived from it at row level
Dataset/
data/raw/
*.csv
*.csv.zip
2019-*.csv*

# /data/ is already ignored above and stays that way: it is where downloaded
# research data lands locally. Committed reference artifacts live in fixtures/,
# which holds item-level files with no user_id.
*.parquet
!fixtures/**/*.parquet

# Model weights and checkpoints
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.ckpt
checkpoints/

# Local scratch
scratchpad/
_scratch/
.venv/
*.log

# --- project data guards -------------------------------------------------
# This repository is public. Raw events, user trajectories, materialised task
# examples and model weights must never enter it. `*.parquet` was already
# ignored; these close the rest of the door.
INTERNAL_DO_NOT_UPLOAD_*
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.npy
*.npz
**/cache/
**/cache_t2/
**/cache_t3/
Dataset/

# --- Project rules. These come after the template above and override it. ---

# docs/artifacts.md declares the experiment results registry at
# artifacts/experiment-results/*.result.json, but the .NET template above ignores
# artifacts/ wholesale. The result was that a new run wrote its result file, git status
# showed nothing, and the run never reached the repository. Re-include exactly that path
# and nothing else: checkpoints, ONNX exports and scratch output stay ignored.
!artifacts/
artifacts/*
!artifacts/experiment-results/
artifacts/experiment-results/*
!artifacts/experiment-results/*.result.json
